An independent implementation of jukebox chest playlists introduced in
Minecraft 26.4 Snapshot 4. Minecraft game code and assets are not included.
Optional integration with LazoDiscs uses its public interoperability API;
LazoDiscs and Plasmo Voice are not bundled inside the playlist mod JARs.
